<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Jasco still in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Jasco still in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jasco Electronics Ltd said on Wednesday it was still in talks which, if successfully concluded, could have an effect on its share price on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution in their sharedealings until further.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
